    "date": "2026-08-31",
    "by": "paul-stated",
    "was": "The old draft zone 'Upper-Uber Wall Area' has no counterpart",
    "ruling": "NOT A ZONE AT ALL. paul-stated 2026-08-31: 'It's a wall. More of a dividing line than a zone.' It is a LINEAR feature. The awkward name was the record straining to express a line in a schema that only has polygons."
   }
